# Section 6.5: Automation via Linux Cron & spark-submit

### Step 1: Manual Execution & The Deployment Command
 # Activate the virtual environment:
```bash
source capstone_env/bin/activate
spark-submit --master yarn /home/ubuntu/capstone_project/shopsphere_etl.py

### Step 3: Scheduling with Linux Cron
# Open the cron table editor (press 1 if prompted to select the nano editor):

```bash
crontab -e

# Paste the following scheduling rule at the absolute bottom of the file to automate the ETL pipeline at 2:00 AM daily:

```bash
0 2 * * * /home/ubuntu/spark/bin/spark-submit --master yarn /home/ubuntu/capstone_project/shopsphere_etl.py >> /home/ubuntu/capstone_project/shopsphere_etl.log 2>&1
